# Echo is a static site (the web mirror of the Echo competitor-intel app).
# Nothing here is built, and nothing secret belongs in it. Each user signs in with
# their own Google account and enters their own Gemini key at runtime, stored only in
# their own browser — so no key, token, or credential may ever appear in this repo.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log

# The OAuth *client ID* is public by design and DOES ship in the page (like Sightline).
# But never commit a client secret, an API key, a keystore, or a .env.
.env
*.keystore
*.jks

# Internal working documents live alongside this repo in ../Echo docs/, not inside it.
# Listed here so dropping a copy back in does not quietly publish it.
PRD.md
ARCHITECTURE.md
DESIGN.md
PROMPTING.md
RULES.md
MEMORY.md
README-full.md
